'''Lana''' (Japanese: '''スイレン''' ''Suiren'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=You can use this card only if you have {{TCGP|Araquanid}} in play.
Switch in 1 of your opponent's Benched Pokémon to the Active Spot.
}}

