==Trivia==
* {{TCG|Lana}} also exists in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but has a different effect.

===Origin===
*[[Lana]] is a [[Trial Captain|captain]] in the [[Generation VII]] [[Pokémon games]]. The [[Brooklet Hill]] Totem's Den is featured in the uncommon illustration.

